## P0-4 — `verify_existing_install` 必须验证 Accounting Plane

当前同版本 rerun 主要验证：

```text
sing-box binary
sing-box config
sing-box.service
proxy listener
```

然后宣布 existing installation verified。

对于 v0.2.3 已经不够。

要求至少输出：

```text
[Proxy Plane]
✓ sing-box binary
✓ config
✓ service
✓ listener

[Accounting Plane]
✓ accountd artifact
✓ accountd unit
✓ accountd service active
✓ Clash API reachable
✓ Clash API authentication
✓ SQLite database readable
✓ expected DB schema
✓ collector recently successful
```

只有两组都 PASS：

```text
Vincula healthy
```

否则必须：

```text
DEGRADED / FAIL
```

不能继续输出“installation verified”。

